    sourceTitle: 'Elder Bliss Bhutan Tour 2 Nights / 3 Days Senior-Friendly Bhutan Tour Package Designed for Elderly Travellers',
    description: 'Why Choose Elder Bliss? We believe age should never be a barrier to experiencing Bhutan’s magic. This tour is thoughtfully designed with slower pacing, accessibility in mind, and a compassionate guiding approach—ensuring comfort, dignity, and joy at every step.\n\nTravel with ease, explore with peace. Let us take care of the details while you soak in the serenity of Bhutan.',
